{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Grudge of the Devoured Burns Hotter Than Hell!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pudding Guy once dreamed of sweet love. But the moment he was eaten by humans, his dream was shattered.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now awakened at the bottom of hell, only one thing remains: merciless revenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2288560/extras/5de6350f5fb0c8e9787e6affdcc8c6b5.poster.avif?t=1766084363\" width=654 height=368 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2288560/extras/5de6350f5fb0c8e9787e6affdcc8c6b5.webm?t=1766084363\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2288560/extras/5de6350f5fb0c8e9787e6affdcc8c6b5.mp4?t=1766084363\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd25 <strong>Game Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Relentless Bullet Hell</strong><br>Can you endure attacks that come even from the background? Some cannot be blocked by shields!<br>Keep your shield up and fly constantly to survive!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No Saves, Only Skill (Hardcore Experience)</strong><br>There is no save function in this game. Death means returning to the very beginning.<br>Do not despair\u2014through repeated challenges, your control will become sharper than ever.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique Guardians of Hell</strong><br>Each floor awaits with massive bosses. Break through their unpredictable patterns and feel the thrill of victory!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2288560/extras/abc444fbf9da238eb11f32a81606fd4c.poster.avif?t=1766084363\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2288560/extras/abc444fbf9da238eb11f32a81606fd4c.webm?t=1766084363\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2288560/extras/abc444fbf9da238eb11f32a81606fd4c.mp4?t=1766084363\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\ude80 <strong>2.0 UPDATE: The Evolved Revenge System</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Companions Appear</strong>: The lonely fight is over. Meet a reliable partner in hell and conquer the battlefield together.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Coin Shop &amp; Ring System</strong>: Defeat enemies to collect coins. Buy powerful rings to customize Pudding\u2019s abilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategic Power-Ups</strong>: Your equipment determines the difficulty of escaping hell. Build your own playstyle!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2288560/extras/f148d83ffe1d2b1cad117233b53b5d47.avif?t=1766084363\" width=1560 height=578 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfc6 <strong>Challenge Toward the True Ending</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Escaping hell is not the end. If you reach the ultimate peak and defeat the final boss,<br>the door to the \u201cTrue Ending\u201d that no one has ever seen will open.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Test your limits and fulfill Pudding Guy\u2019s lost love.<br>Kick open the gates of hell now!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Developer\u2019s Note:</strong> We actively reflected user feedback to balance difficulty and update systems. Painful yet addictive\u2014enjoy the challenge!</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Delicious Pudding","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2288560/aae43c7d4751aa2223f01ded1e967623beb11102.jpg"},{"name":"True Happiness","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2288560/a8000226236440f825529aafe00229b69f962a7f.jpg"},{"name":"Command Master","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2288560/59985841cbd37c64bc0eb006443d3ba9385459f1.jpg"},{"name":"Life is precious","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2288560/63da5c7fa179d79862dd55fc5612f703c3befb19.jpg"},{"name":"Gambling is moderately","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2288560/01895ad5d2b658733ccf21e52a972b3041e2d3f2.jpg"},{"name":"Lucky Pudding","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2288560/ddb9fef0ba6ad187ddbb7a149e12a3b8d0a04324.jpg"},{"name":"Combo Master","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2288560/4e49f277050164b92fd4720a74572a74372469f7.jpg"},{"name":"Emancipated Angel Ring","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2288560/19b467188b35f0a1210144439908c215b525ba7a.jpg"},{"name":"Reliable Partner","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2288560/9a37917d7274942273fe13a4dee1909e25f244d5.jpg"},{"name":"Crow Lord","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2288560/edcc381c5beacc0c62a8e42272d0c3d24f4f48e4.jpg"}],"total":23},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2288560?t=1766084363","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2288560?t=1766084363","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.