 control will become sharper than ever.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique Guardians of Hell</strong><br>Each floor awaits with massive bosses. Break through their unpredictable patterns and feel the thrill of victory!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2288560/extras/abc444fbf9da238eb11f32a81606fd4c.poster.avif?t=1766084363\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2288560/extras/abc444fbf9da238eb11f32a81606fd4c.webm?t=1766084363\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2288560/extras/abc444fbf9da238eb11f32a81606fd4c.mp4?t=1766084363\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\ude80 <strong>2.0 UPDATE: The Evolved Revenge System</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Companions Appear</strong>: The lonely fight is over. Meet a reliable partner in hell and conquer the battlefield together.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Coin Shop &amp; Ring System</strong>: Defeat enemies to collect coins. Buy powerful rings to customize Pudding\u2019s abilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategic Power-Ups</strong>: Your equipment determines the difficulty of escaping hell. Build your own playstyle!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2288560/extras/f148d83ffe1d2b1cad117233b53b5d47.avif?t=1766084363\" width=1560 height=578 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfc6 <strong>Challenge Toward the True Ending</strong><